# Density Compare
# Lanthanum (La) — real density 6.162 g/cm³. equal masses: Lanthanum vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Lanthanum Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.9mm color: #4d6fff at (-20mm, 5.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 49.1 g — the water cube is the reference
